  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Data Explorer provides the flexibility to build and organize your own customized views of metrics to analyze data."
    },
    {
      "text": "To configure a view:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Analytics > Business Insights > Data Explorer.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          15
        ],
        [
          18,
          35
        ],
        [
          38,
          51
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Data Explorer page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can select from existing templates and modify them as necessary, or you can create your own view.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Metrics section, select the metrics for the view. You can select multiple metrics:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Bytes",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Visits",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Transactions",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Occupancy",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Attendance",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Operations section, structure the view using the following operators:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "a. Group By",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Select an option to group data by:",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Office",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Work Mode",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "b. Aggregation",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the data aggregation:",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Daily",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "c. Aggregation Type",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the data aggregation function:",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Sum",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Maximum",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Minimum",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Average",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "This option is not available for daily aggregation.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Filters section, click Add to narrow the results of your view for a specific Geolocation and Work Mode.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          30,
          33
        ],
        [
          84,
          95
        ],
        [
          100,
          109
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Chart Type section, select a chart type icon to display data in a specific chart or tabular format.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Time Period section, select an option to process the data for the Last 7 days, Last Day, Last Week, Last Month, Week, Month, or 3 Months.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          18
        ],
        [
          73,
          84
        ],
        [
          86,
          94
        ],
        [
          96,
          100
        ],
        [
          101,
          105
        ],
        [
          107,
          117
        ],
        [
          119,
          123
        ],
        [
          125,
          130
        ],
        [
          135,
          143
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Run Query to display your customized view in the right pane.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can click Reset to configure another view.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          14,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You can analyze the data using the following options:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Export Full Report to download a detailed report.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Export to download the data as a CSV file.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save and Schedule to schedule a report based on the applied filter. You can schedule Data Explorer reports only when the time period selected is Last Day, Last Week, or Last Month. To learn more, see Scheduling Data Explorer Reports.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ],
        [
          151,
          159
        ],
        [
          161,
          170
        ],
        [
          175,
          185
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Search for a specific metric to select or deselect it from the view.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Select or deselect metrics from the chart view.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
